    (assert-text t "T5w;Gh;R;Ch[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Deposit];Ch[Withdrawal];Che[Balance];Gb;R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Transfer];C[];Ce[181.04];Ce[149,818.96];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Electronic transfer];C[];Ce[1.00];Ce[999.99];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Transfer];C[];Ce[181.04];Ce[149,818.96];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Electronic transfer];C[];Ce[1.00];Ce[999.99];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Transfer];C[];Ce[181.04];Ce[149,818.96];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Electronic transfer];C[];Ce[1.00];Ce[999.99];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Transfer];C[];Ce[181.04];Ce[149,818.96];R;C[20 Sep];Cs[Electronic transfer];C[];Ce[1.00];Ce[999.99];" "the empty band retains its header and every amount stays at its geometric anchor")))

(deftest test-right-aligned-amounts-make-one-numeric-column
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells)
        ^Cells tb (new-cells) ^Cells tc (new-cells) ^Cells tw (new-cells) ^Cells tbk (new-cells) ^Cells pages (new-cells)]
    (page-new pages 1 61200 79200 0 (pk-vector))
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Item") 7600 10000 1 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Amount") 40500 10000 1 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "One") 7600 11600 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "1.00") 40500 11600 0 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Ten") 7600 13200 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "10.00") 40500 13200 0 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Thousand") 7600 14800 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "1,000.00") 40500 14800 0 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Hundred") 7600 16400 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "100.00") 40500 16400 0 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Total") 7600 18000 1 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "1,111.00") 40500 18000 1 1)
    (assert-eq (tb-build wd ln et (new-cells) (new-cells) 1
                        tb tc tw (new-cells) (new-cells) tbk (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        pages (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells)) 1 "the amounts make one table")
    (assert-eq (tt-body-audit wd et tb tc tw) 0 "the numeric-model fixture has unique body ownership")
    (assert-eq (tb-model-col tb tbk 0 1 3) 40500 "varying widths share their right anchor")
    (assert-eq (tb-model-col tb tbk 0 1 5) 3 "the numeric column is an amount column")
    (assert-eq (tb-model-col tb tbk 0 1 9) 4 "all four body rows support the anchor")))

;; P12.10 partition controls: the same ledger and summary in both orders.
(defn ^I32 tt-part-ledger [^:mut ^Cells wd ^:mut ^Cells ln ^:mut ^Cells et ^I32 y]
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Date") 7600 y 1 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Details") 15000 y 1 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Amount") 43000 y 1 1)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "01Jan") 7600 (+ y 1600) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Rent") 15000 (+ y 1600) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "1.00") 43000 (+ y 1600) 0 1)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "02Jan") 7600 (+ y 3200) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Electricity") 15000 (+ y 3200) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "20.00") 43000 (+ y 3200) 0 1)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "03Jan") 7600 (+ y 4800) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Service fee") 15000 (+ y 4800) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "300.00") 43000 (+ y 4800) 0 1)
  (return 0))

(defn ^I32 tt-part-summary [^:mut ^Cells wd ^:mut ^Cells ln ^:mut ^Cells et ^I32 y]
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Subtotal") 7600 y 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "31.00") 43000 y 0 1)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Tax") 7600 (+ y 1600) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "6.20") 43000 (+ y 1600) 0 1)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Total") 7600 (+ y 3200) 0 0)
  (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "37.20") 43000 (+ y 3200) 0 1)
  (return 0))

(deftest test-a-summary-below-a-ledger-is-its-own-table
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells) ^Cells pa (new-cells) ^Text t (new-text)]
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (tt-part-summary wd ln et 16400)
    (assert-eq (tt-run wd ln et pa t) 0 "partitioned tables are well formed")
    (assert-text t "T3w;Gh;R;Ch[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Amount];Gb;R;C[01Jan];Cs[Rent];Ce[1.00];R;C[02Jan];Cs[Electricity];Ce[20.00];R;C[03Jan];Cs[Service fee];Ce[300.00];T2w;Gb;R;Cs[Subtotal];C[31.00];R;Cs[Tax];C[6.20];R;Cs[Total];C[37.20];" "the two column models have disjoint intervals and preserve every row")))

(deftest test-the-first-transaction-after-a-summary-belongs-to-the-ledger
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells) ^Cells pa (new-cells) ^Text t (new-text)]
    (tt-part-summary wd ln et 10000)
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 14800)
    (assert-eq (tt-run wd ln et pa t) 0 "partitioned tables are well formed")
    (assert-text t "T2w;Gb;R;Cs[Subtotal];C[31.00];R;Cs[Tax];C[6.20];R;Cs[Total];C[37.20];T3w;Gh;R;Ch[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Amount];Gb;R;C[01Jan];Cs[Rent];Ce[1.00];R;C[02Jan];Cs[Electricity];Ce[20.00];R;C[03Jan];Cs[Service fee];Ce[300.00];" "the two column models have disjoint intervals and preserve every row")))

(deftest test-a-heading-between-two-tables-is-owned-by-neither
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells) ^Cells pa (new-cells) ^Text t (new-text)]
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Between tables") 7600 16400 1 0)
    (let [^I32 heading-word (- (wd-count wd) 1)]
      (wd-set wd heading-word (wf-size) 1800))
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 18000)
    (assert-eq (tt-run wd ln et pa t) 0 "a foreign heading is well formed outside both tables")
    (assert-text t "T3w;Gh;R;Ch[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Amount];Gb;R;C[01Jan];Cs[Rent];Ce[1.00];R;C[02Jan];Cs[Electricity];Ce[20.00];R;C[03Jan];Cs[Service fee];Ce[300.00];P[Between tables];T3w;Gh;R;Ch[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Amount];Gb;R;C[01Jan];Cs[Rent];Ce[1.00];R;C[02Jan];Cs[Electricity];Ce[20.00];R;C[03Jan];Cs[Service fee];Ce[300.00];" "a heading-size line is owned by neither neighboring table")))

(deftest test-empty-date-markers-do-not-split-a-ledger
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells) ^Cells pa (new-cells) ^Text t (new-text)]
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "–") 7600 16400 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Pending") 15000 16400 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "4.00") 43000 16400 0 1)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "–") 7600 18000 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Unspecified") 15000 18000 0 0)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "5.00") 43000 18000 0 1)
    (assert-eq (tt-run wd ln et pa t) 0 "empty date markers preserve all rows")
    (assert-text t "T3w;Gh;R;Chs[Date];Chs[Details];Ch[Amount];Gb;R;Cs[01Jan];Cs[Rent];Ce[1.00];R;Cs[02Jan];Cs[Electricity];Ce[20.00];R;Cs[03Jan];Cs[Service fee];Ce[300.00];R;Cs[–];Cs[Pending];Ce[4.00];R;Cs[–];Cs[Unspecified];Ce[5.00];" "punctuation placeholders are not a different date-column model")))

;; P12.10 ownership: inspect the same retained cells used by Model emission.
(defn ^I32 tt-own-build [^Cells wd ^:mut ^Cells ln ^Cells et ^:mut ^Cells tb ^:mut ^Cells tc ^:mut ^Cells tw ^:mut ^Cells tbo]
  (let [^Cells pages (new-cells)]
    (page-new pages 1 61200 79200 0 (pk-vector))
    (tb-build wd ln et (new-cells) (new-cells) 1 tb tc tw (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) tbo
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        pages (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells) (new-cells)
                        (new-cells) (new-cells))
    (if (!= (tt-body-audit wd et tb tc tw) 0) (return -7))
    (return (quot (cells-len tb) 32))))

(deftest test-every-word-in-a-table-body-has-one-owner
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells)
        ^Cells tb (new-cells) ^Cells tc (new-cells) ^Cells tw (new-cells) ^Cells tbo (new-cells)
        ^:mut ^I32 w 0 ^:mut ^I32 c 0 ^:mut ^I32 i 0 ^:mut ^I32 count 0]
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (assert-eq (tt-own-build wd ln et tb tc tw tbo) 1 "one retained ledger")
    (assert-eq (cells-len tbo) (wd-count wd) "the page ownership arena has a slot per word")
    (if (== (cells-len tbo) (wd-count wd))
      (while (< w (wd-count wd))
        (do (set count 0) (set c (cells-at tb 9))
            (while (< c (+ (cells-at tb 9) (cells-at tb 10)))
              (do (set i 0)
                  (while (< i (cells-at tc (+ (* c 16) 9)))
                    (do (if (== (cells-at tw (+ (cells-at tc (+ (* c 16) 8)) i)) w)
                          (do (set count (+ count 1))
                              (assert-eq (cells-at tbo w) (+ c 1) "ownership names the emitting cell")))
                        (set i (+ i 1))))
                  (set c (+ c 1))))
            (assert-eq count 1 "each ledger word occurs in exactly one retained cell")
            (set w (+ w 1)))))))

(deftest test-an-unowned-account-label-is-table-context
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells)
        ^Cells tb (new-cells) ^Cells tc (new-cells) ^Cells tw (new-cells) ^Cells tbo (new-cells)]
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "USD Savings Account") 7600 8400 0 0)
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (assert-eq (tt-own-build wd ln et tb tc tw tbo) 1 "one ledger below an account label")
    (assert-eq (cells-at tb 30) 0 "the nearest unowned label is recorded by line index")))

(deftest test-rotated-overlay-words-inside-a-table-stay-explicitly-dropped
  (let [^Cells wd (new-cells) ^Cells ln (new-cells) ^Cells et (new-cells)
        ^Cells tb (new-cells) ^Cells tc (new-cells) ^Cells tw (new-cells) ^Cells tbo (new-cells)]
    (tt-part-ledger wd ln et 10000)
    (tt-at wd ln et (text-blob "Overlay") 20000 14000 0 0)
    (wd-set wd 12 (hd-rot) 4500)
    (assert-eq (tt-own-build wd ln et tb tc tw tbo) 1 "the rotated overlay is no table cell")
    (assert-eq (cells-at tbo 12) -1 "a rotated overlay rejected by the row builder stays explicitly dropped")))

